WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.945
If a raised issue can be handled one level lower, first verify that the blocker has been removed.

00:00:05.945 --> 00:00:11.295
In the Escalation Ladder choose De-escalate and enter a reason that the next owner can act on.

00:00:11.295 --> 00:00:12.545
Confirm the move.

00:00:12.545 --> 00:00:15.465
Check the new highlighted rung and expand History.

00:00:15.465 --> 00:00:18.625
The earlier escalation remains part of the audit trail.
